      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Sort of?  It depends on the order of which things are processed.  If the non-existant property is in the middle of that list, then we have a half-applied mutation.  I'd either want it to succeed or fail, not be half applied.</p>",
     "created": "12/Nov/15 1:00 PM",
     "id": "15818",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11551/comment/15818",
