      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>That's my point. Or is this issue saying that we currently do have partial application? That's not very clear to me.</p>",
     "created": "12/Nov/15 1:03 PM",
     "id": "15819",
     "jsdPublic": true,
