     "body": "<p>Should the SPARQL be?</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>PREFIX dc: &lt;http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/&gt; \r\n  \r\nDELETE { \r\n  &lt;&gt; dc:title ?o0 . \r\n  &lt;&gt; dc:author ?o1 . \r\n} \r\nWHERE {\r\n  &lt;&gt; dc:title ?o0 .\r\n  &lt;&gt; dc:author ?o1 .\r\n}\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
     "created": "10/Mar/16 12:56 PM",
     "id": "16296",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11551/comment/16296",
     "updateAuthor": {
